  "root_cause": {
    "status": "confirmed",
    "summary": "The topology configures both application runners with the PostgreSQL bootstrap role incidentseal. That role is the database superuser and can create roles, databases, tables, replication connections, and bypass row-level security. Internal-network isolation does not make those database privileges least-privilege.",
